{title: Majnu}
{artist: Mika Singh Sharib Toshi}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm] Ho Din Raat Yun,        Sochta [Gm] Hoon Tujhe
[Cm] Haasil Karun [Gm] Kaise,        Sanam Tujh [G#] ko [A#] Main
Tujhe [Cm] Kya Kahun Main,        Tujhe [Gm] Kya Kahun Main
[G#] Kaisa Junoon Hai [A#] Mera,        Tujhe [Cm] Jabse Mila Hoon
[A#] So Na Saka Hoon,        [G#] Bas Hai Khayal [A#] Tera
Kabhi [Cm] Majnu Bana,        Kabhi [A#] Ranjha Bana Hoon
[G#] Aisa Hai Haal [A#] Mera,        [Cm] Dil Ko Mere [Gm] Kab Yeh Hua
[G#] Mujhko Pata Na [A#] Chala,        [Cm] Sau Sau Dafa [Gm] Dekhun Tujhe
[G#] Tu Hi Toh Rab Hai [A#] Mera,        [Cm] Bulle Nu Samjhawan Aaiyan
[A#] Behna Te Bharjaaiyan,        [G#] Mann Le Bulleya Sadda Kehna
[A#] Chhadd De Palla Raahiyan,        Par [Cm] Main Sunu Na
Par [Gm] Main Sunu Na,        [G#] Ab Toh Kisi Ki [A#] Sada
Tujhe [Cm] Jabse Mila Hoon,        [A#] So Na Saka Hoon
[G#] Bas Hai Khayal [A#] Tera,        Kabhi [Cm] Majnu Bana
Kabhi [A#] Ranjha Bana Hoon,        [G#] Aisa Hai Haal [A#] Mera
